{"server":"cn","storyId":"act33side_level_act33side_st03","groupId":"act33side","stageId":"act33side_st03","title":"灵魂尽头","storyCode":"BB-ST-3","avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act33side/level_act33side_st03.txt","sourceHash":"e13e5cb8b9d158d8d44d6b6a80f1e70ce6ce204e3fa57191128b50288705cc98","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_light"},{"type":"narration","text":"抹除记忆。对特蕾西娅来说，她亦缺少足够的经验。\n更不必论，她此刻不得不面对一种她知之甚少的思维。\n她不知道会遇见什么，也无法预料是否会带来危险，但她并没有退缩的余地。\n这已是她生命最后的决定。\n她走在博士的记忆中，无数的记忆被拆解成为丝线消散。\n记忆在消逝。无声无息。\n她走过了从未见识，也无法认知的世界。\n如此辉煌的文明为何会终结？\n如流星般璀璨的天才们又为何对这个终极问题苦苦求索而无解？\n抵抗是否没有意义？团结是否只是空想？\n泰拉的未来是否已然注定？她所爱的家园呢？\n她所爱的人呢？\n她没有答案。她找不到答案。\n她只能继续漫步于记忆散去后的虚无。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"终于，她看到了熟悉的人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_rhodescom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大家的热情让你无所适从吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎么来了，凯尔希。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是庆祝你又一次大胜的庆典，难道我不该到场吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道的，我很久没有......我们那时候，能庆祝的日子不多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"该如何庆祝，我已经有些生疏了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没关系，你会慢慢熟悉的。巴别塔会成为一个新的开始。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去吧，我们应该好好庆祝一番。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"特蕾西娅看到凯尔希抬手拍了拍博士的后背，轻轻将那人推向等候已久的人群。\n有太多人挤过来了，一双双手伸向前，争先恐后想要同博士握握手，拍拍博士的肩膀。\n还有些个子很高的家伙，胆子很大，竟然直接将手放在博士的脑袋上狠狠揉了揉。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Scout","speakerId":"avg_npc_1311_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，我替手下的冒失向您道歉，博士，我刚想阻止他......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Scout","speakerId":"avg_npc_1311_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我的胳膊受伤了......根本来不及。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"没关系......伤势如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Scout","speakerId":"avg_npc_1311_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恢复得不错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可惜，今夜有很多饮品你都没办法享用了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"avg_npc_1309_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没关系，博士，我会代这家伙多喝上几杯的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"avg_npc_1309_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要不是您最后果断地变招突袭，我们恐怕都要落进包围网里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"avg_npc_1309_1","isRemote":false,"text":"来，敬您，我们可得好好喝上几杯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"恐怕我的酒量会让你失望，Ace先生。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_050","isRemote":false,"text":"让一让，让一让，我都要看不见今天的主角了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_050","isRemote":false,"text":"这么多人，我还是第一次觉得这间指挥室这么小，要不要之后帮你扩建一下啊？外面可还有好多人提着好吃的赶过来呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，大家都在为您所带来的胜利而欢呼，但您看上去有些......不自在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我以为自己遮掩得不错。咳，只是在人群中觉得紧张。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Scout","speakerId":"avg_npc_1311_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿，小心，别往前挤了。阿米娅，你还好吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我没事！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士！快和我来，我和特蕾西娅小姐为你准备了烤蛋糕！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看，烤箱特别烫，还把我的手指烫了一个泡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢......呃！这没事吗？谁有烫伤膏......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一声轻轻的咳嗽响起，人群应声向两边散开。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"特蕾西娅看到了一个身着白裙的女人擦肩而过，笑着向博士伸出一只手，手上有未愈的针刺伤口。\n那是她自己。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_light"},{"type":"narration","text":"喜悦淡去，记忆淡去，耳边的声音淡去。\n特蕾西娅抹除这段自己也无比熟悉的记忆，接着向前走去。\n她看到了一段自己从未在PRTS中看到的记录。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_abyss_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"调用影像功能。启用管理员权限加密。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"影像编号<color=#FF4200>（0091_admin）</color>......添加主题：<color=#FF4200>（这是留给你的）</color>。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"启动记录......开始录影。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我没有坚持到你醒来，你会看到这段视频。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"在一切尘埃落定之前，我会留在这里，留在最安全的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"在我做完所有的一切之后，我会在沉默中消失......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"消失在所有恨我的人面前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"我的心中时刻有一个声音提醒我，拷问我——“我是谁？”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"是我们自身的守望者？还是后来文明的背叛者？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"我已经无法认清我自己——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"查看所有我留下的记录之后，你会得出一个答案。但至少此刻，我已不再犹豫自己该做什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"......我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"当你醒来，我应该已经消失在你的过去，不会再出现在我们约定的未来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我希望......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"......记录暂停。删除刚才的所有内容。我......还需要一点时间。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_light"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"narration","text":"她没有犹豫，没有叹息，只是默默继续做着该做的事情。\n特蕾西娅越走越深，靠近了埋藏在更深处的回忆。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"46_g4_rmbtwild_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1360_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我需要你们联络最近的救援队！失事的运输队车辆上有雷姆必拓的标志，这是你们的队伍......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1360_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我听到里面还有幸存者的声音！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"通讯声","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"滋——我们已经联系上，但是从最近的采矿地块赶到现场还需要时间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"通讯声","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"听您的反馈，那里曾发生过抢劫案，我们同样要通知武装安保，让他们立刻出发。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......唔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1360_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......武装安保......但雷姆必拓对没有家庭支持的感染者......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1360_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啧——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"49_i20_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"坚持一下......我现在就能把你拉出来......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"千万不要睡着......嘶......好孩子，把手伸过来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"抓住！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可......我......好累......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你的名字是什么——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......我——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"名字......？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"49_i20_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"妈妈......叫我......阿米娅......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅，坚持一下，抓紧我的手！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我......抓住你了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我不会放手——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"记忆破碎。\n这里就是特蕾西娅的终点，博士记忆的终点——\n“特蕾西娅......”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不可能，明明所有的记忆都已经......"},{"type":"narration","text":"“特蕾西娅。”\n她循着声音，来到了一处虚无之前，声音从虚无之后传来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这里是哪里——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"31_g3_mini12_farmland"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你终于走到了这里，我在等你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士......？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1360_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1360_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很少有人会这么叫我，他们喜欢称呼我的团队代号——“预言家”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......预言家......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，凯尔希信任的，其实是你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"预言家","speakerId":"avg_npc_1360_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很对不起凯尔希。但没办法，我确实深陷一个避无可避的阳谋之中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"预言家","speakerId":"avg_npc_1360_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我一直在这里看着你，看着你为希望奔走，看着你为背叛而痛苦——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"预言家","speakerId":"avg_npc_1360_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就像看着曾经的我自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......抱歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在的你只是博士情感燃烧后的残渣，我没办法在这样的情况下，单独保留下你的情感和记忆......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"预言家","speakerId":"avg_npc_1360_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你已经来到了终点，做你该做的吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"预言家","speakerId":"avg_npc_1360_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢你相信我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......也许有些迟了，不过，很高兴见到你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"预言家","speakerId":"avg_npc_1360_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也很高兴见到你，特蕾西娅。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"预言家走向了远方无尽的麦田，消失在其中。\n气流肆虐过麦田，哗哗作响，空间中最后的景象也崩解四散，直到翻出丝线的尽头。\n特蕾西娅牵住它，很快，丝线开始逐渐失去光泽，碎成粉末。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到了说再见的时候了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"未来，我们还会再见的吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凯尔希......阿米娅......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......{@nickname}。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"特蕾西娅松开了手中最后的线头，目睹它如星光般散开，消逝。\n她迈开步走去，走向了希望......\n走向了死亡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
